. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","sd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","dk"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["hs","sc"],["at","Dummy's remaining diamond honor is cashed on which South must discard the @CK (if South discards a small club then West can deny declarer the dummy entries he needs by playing a high club whenever South leads a low club toward the dummy). "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","sc"],["pc","da"],["pc","d"],["pc","ck"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nh"],["hs","ss"],["at","South then ruffs a heart in the closed hand. "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["ls","ss"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","s"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["hs","wc"],["nt","South's next move is to play a club towards the dummy, planning to finesse the @C9 if West follows small. "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["ls","wc"],["pc","c6"],["pc","cj"],["pc","cq"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["hs","ss"],["at","South ruffs a diamond in hand, "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","ss"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","s"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["at","crosses back to the dummy in clubs (finessing if West split his honors on the first round), "],["pg","ls"],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["hs","ss"],["at","and ruffs dummy's last diamond. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","ss"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","s"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["at","The third round of clubs puts the lead back in dummy "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","nh"],["hs","es"],["hs","ws"],["at","and the play of dummy's last heart leaves the defense with no answer."],["",""]]}}